    "vendor SVG inside assets/icons/<p>/. Consumed by scripts/build-icon-modules.mjs,",
    "which generates src/providers/<p>/officialIcons.js.",
    "A null value means the bundle has no official icon for that key; the",
    "provider module keeps a neutral, non-branded placeholder glyph instead.",
    "Some keys intentionally share a file (e.g. aws subnet/nat/internet gateway",
    "use the official Amazon VPC icon — the bundle only ships service-level",
